## .gitignore para .NET 9 + Visual Studio 2022
## Gerado para uso com C#, ASP.NET Core, WPF, WinForms, MAUI, Blazor, etc.

# ============================================================
# VISUAL STUDIO
# ============================================================

# Arquivos de usuário
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Arquivos de configuração local do VS
*.rsuser

# Mono auto-tuning
mono_crash.*

# Histórico de build e compilação
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# ============================================================
# .NET / MSBuild
# ============================================================

# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# Pasta de cache do NuGet local
.nuget/

# MSBuild
*.TargetFrameworks.props

# Resultados de testes
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# Cobertura de código
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*/
**/coverage.json
**/coverage.opencover.xml
**/coverage.cobertura.xml
TestResults/

# BenchmarkDotNet
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# .NET CLI / SDK
global.json.bak
dotnet-tools.json.bak

# Runtime
*.runtimeconfig.dev.json

# ============================================================
# PUBLISH / DEPLOY
# ============================================================

*.[Pp]ublish.xml
*.azurePubxml
*.pubxml
*.pubxml.user
PublishScripts/

# Azure
ServiceFabricBackup/
*.mfractor

# ============================================================
# ROSLYN / ANALISADORES
# ============================================================

*.GeneratedMSBuildEditorConfig.editorconfig

# ============================================================
# RESHARPER
# ============================================================

_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

# ============================================================
# RIDER (JetBrains)
# ============================================================

.idea/
*.sln.iml

# ============================================================
# DOTCOVER / DOTMEMORY / DOTPEEK / DOTTRACE
# ============================================================

*.dotCover

# ============================================================
# VISUAL STUDIO CODE
# ============================================================

.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/*.code-snippets
.history/
*.vsix

